abstract: >-
  XGBoost churn prediction with SHAP attributions, plus an inverse-probability-of-treatment
  weighted estimate of what product adoption does to churn, monthly purchase and CLTV,
  reported with covariate-balance diagnostics, effective sample size, a positivity check
  and a propensity-matched cross-check.
